// LLAMP-SPEC v1 | CURRENT_DECISIONS
// task: POC Demo Seed Script | date: 2026-04-16

#what_changed
=apps/api/src/scripts/seed-demo.ts (new):
  stable hardcoded IDs (01SEEDDEMO…) for idempotent upserts
  upsert key: Application={orgId,slug} Device={orgId,deviceId} MqttGateway={orgId,name} Dashboard={orgId,dashboardId}
  AlarmRule upsert key: {tagName} ONLY — model has no orgId field

=apps/api/package.json:
  "seed:demo": "tsx src/scripts/seed-demo.ts"

=iot-platform/package.json:
  "seed:demo": "cd apps/api && pnpm seed:demo"

#tech_implications
~AlarmRule model is NOT org-scoped (no orgId field) — do not include orgId in AlarmRule queries
~Device.deviceId is NOT auto-generated — must be provided on upsert; findOneAndUpdate pre-save hooks don't run
~Dashboard.pages is [Schema.Types.Mixed] — extra fields like layoutSchemaVersion are stored without error
~MqttGateway has no unique index on {orgId,name} — upsert by name works but not enforced at DB level

#constraints
~seed:demo is idempotent — stable IDs ensure same run twice yields no duplicate docs
~ulid@3.0.2 is available in apps/api but not needed (stable hardcoded strings used instead)
~AlarmRule: requiresAcknowledgment only true for CRITICAL rules
